OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a woman in her 70s.
OL,10,FAnnette Bishop died after she was found
OL,11,Fwith serious injuries on Friday at an
OL,12,Faddress on Sherbourne Avenue in Bradley
OL,13,FStoke, on the outskirts of Bristol.
OL,15,FGerald Bishop, 73, was charged with
OL,16,Fmurder on Sunday and appeared at
OL,17,FBristol Crown Court on Tuesday where a
OL,18,Fprovisional trial date was set for 5
OL,19,FApril, 2027.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
