OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bail application was denied by Judge
OL,7,FBlair KC, and Bishop will next be in
OL,8,Fcourt for a plea and trial preparation
OL,9,Fhearing set for 30 November.
